## 💻 Digital Twin & Decision-Support Model Architecture (Module 1 Scope)

The core deliverable of Module 1 is a **conceptual Digital Twin and decision-support model** operating in a passive shadow mode at the Dorohusk border checkpoint. Rather than functioning purely as an operational routing system, the platform unifies real-time logistics telemetry with empirical physics engines to serve as a **sustainability-informed decision-making engine**
.

